# The agent runs on Linux/WSL/macOS — scripts MUST be LF in the repo and on checkout,
# or bash/python break with \r errors. Normalize text, force LF for executable formats.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.txt  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf

# Leave binaries alone
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.gz  binary
